# decode_base_levers.env: the 6 bitwise lever settings of the afcaf734 base gen env that differ from the lever auto defaults (dieexp lever
# audit 2026-11-15, lanes/gen/dx_LEVER_AUDIT.md). banked_stack_bk3fa.env / w256_W6.env were measured as delta layers over that base;
# without these lines they lose them. Every other afcaf734 key resolves to its auto default. Apply FIRST, at every TEP8 decode mbs.
# 1 G143 (Hecate 1034677): QKV prep folded into the 2-CTA split-K epilogue, 65..128 rows (256 with W6); bs12 -0.070 / bs16 -0.060 ms.
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_TEP8_WIDE64_SPLITK__PREP_FOLD=1
# 2-4 G89 / G101 round-2 bundle: packed prep append (>= 33 rows), step-commit overlap fold 2, hop entry trigger at the input boundary.
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_PACKED_PREP_APPEND=on
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_STEP_COMMIT_V2__OVERLAP_FOLD=2
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_HOP_ENTRY_TRIGGER__INPUT_BOUNDARY=1
# 5 G104 (Hecate 1031505) / G106: distributed sampler on the fabric + verify grid; -0.02 / -0.03 / -0.07 ms at bs8 / 12 / 16, token-exact.
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_HEAD_SAMPLER_COOP_FOLD__DIST_FABRIC=1
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_HEAD_SAMPLER_COOP_FOLD__VERIFY_GRID=1
# 6 G68 (1029898 / 1030404): drafter paged commit; -0.045 / 0 / -0.10 ms at bs8 / 12 / 16 (inside the G100 gate).
MUSESPARK_OPEN_LEVER_DRAFTER_KV_FORK_BEFORE_HEAD__PAGED_COMMIT=1
